# The behaviour kept across a sequence (fixtures/wmemo: a save with
# Twinsen outside the prison's back door and facing
# it, and the CD's LBA.CFG with LbaWinSettings: 214). He walks into the
# door's zone, F2 makes him sporty, and W opens the door: its script
# makes him normal and walks him in, into the prison, whose script gives
# him back his moves and the sporty behaviour he had. Space makes him
# jump.

hold 0.05
sleep 40
key Down Return
sleep 3
key Return
hold 0.15
sleep 12
shot start
down Up
sleep 0.8
up Up
sleep 1
key F2
sleep 2
shot sporty
key w
sleep 2
shot door
sleep 8
shot inside
key space
sleep 0.5
shot jump
sleep 3
shot end
